    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adds a pure, read-only edit-plan producer: a closed list of governed operations, each guarded by the digest of the target it was planned against, checked against ownership, a work scope and the amendment rules, previewed as exact post-image bytes, and classified by authority effect. Refusals come from a closed set. Nothing in spec-spine applies a plan.\n",
